UnitCLFactory::SetClPoolTapeManager
├── when caller isn't clPoolTapeManager
│   └── it reverts with NotClPoolTapeManager
└── when caller is clPoolTapeManager
    ├── when new clPoolTapeManager is address zero
    │   └── it reverts with ClPoolTapeManagerIsZero
    └── when new clPoolTapeManager isn't address zero
        ├── it sets clPoolTapeManager to new clPoolTapeManager
        └── it emits ClPoolTapeManagerChanged
